Keeps this directory present in the repository and in the container image.

/.well-known/ is a registered public path: Android (assetlinks.json) and Apple
(apple-app-site-association) only trust the App Links / Universal Links
association files when they are served from the site root under it.

The files are generated by WellKnownController (see config/mobile_links.php);
Apache's front-controller rule forwards these paths to Laravel. Do not add
dot-directories here — the vhost denies them, with .well-known itself the only
exception (see api/docker/apache.conf).
